{"id":"n73267-1-7","stage":3,"title":"풀 · 糨糊","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73267-1-7-1","ko":"밀가루로 풀을 쑤어서 어디에 쓰게?","zh":"你用面粉熬浆糊，打算做什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밀가루로","meaning":"面，面粉","explanation":"밀가루：面，面粉；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"밀가루","audio":"/audio/db2374a87cd050f03efb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57411","senseId":"1","lemma":"밀가루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밀가루로","audio":"/audio/1f8eaae20cf9b9bf9f28.mp3"}},{"text":"풀을","meaning":"糨糊，糨子","explanation":"풀：糨糊，糨子；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"풀","audio":"/audio/9f4ab3b56eddc42cf4c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73267","senseId":"1","lemma":"풀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"풀을","audio":"/audio/02eb82b1c33b21f31299.mp3"}},{"text":"쑤어서","meaning":"熬","explanation":"쑤다：熬；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"쑤다","audio":"/audio/d70b1f0025537778c59f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66421","senseId":"1","lemma":"쑤다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쑤어서","audio":"/audio/abf713d87e0db7c8e832.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰게?","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；게：结合语境表示劝告、目的或反问等，常用于非敬语交谈。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰게","audio":"/audio/c1ba4f04468ff9ded02d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"db2374a87cd050f0","term":"밀가루","zh":"面，面粉","audio":"/audio/db2374a87cd050f03efb.mp3","entryId":"57411","definition":"由小麦磨成的粉末。","pronunciation":["밀까루"]}